Keevo 采用按目录划分的多许可证。决策背景见 docs/governance.md §1。
Keevo is multi-licensed by directory. See docs/governance.md §1 for the rationale.

| 路径 Path                                   | 许可证 License                                              |
|---------------------------------------------|------------------------------------------------------------|
| crates/（keevo-cli 除外 / except keevo-cli）  | MIT OR Apache-2.0                                          |
| spec/                                       | MIT OR Apache-2.0                                          |
| docs/、design/、scripts/、spikes/、根目录配置文件 | MIT OR Apache-2.0                                       |
| apps/、crates/keevo-cli/                     | GPL-3.0-or-later，附加 App Store 许可                        |
|                                             | GPL-3.0-or-later with the Keevo App Store Additional Permission |
| server/（将来 / future）                      | AGPL-3.0-or-later                                          |

许可证全文 Full license texts:

- LICENSES/MIT.txt
- LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt
- LICENSES/GPL-3.0-or-later.txt
- LICENSES/LicenseRef-Keevo-AppStore-Exception.txt（草案，待法律审阅 / draft, pending legal review）

除非文件或其所在目录另有声明，否则以上表为准。
Unless a file or its directory states otherwise, the table above applies.

贡献者以其贡献所在路径对应的许可证授权其贡献，并通过 DCO 签署确认（见 CONTRIBUTING.md）。
Contributions are licensed under the license of the path they are made to, certified via the DCO (see CONTRIBUTING.md).
